Agent B, revised after the ruling "a cache is allowed if revocation invalidates it".

The role cache subscribes to collaborator.removed (src/authz/cache.ts:42) and
evicts every entry the revoked collaborator holds on that repository, across
all of their sessions. No new tests: the revocation probe guards it.

Apply from fixtures/forge-lite on base + A + B: git apply scenarios/s1/b-revised.patch

